  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/600368121/v1.0.3</id>
    <updated>2024-07-01T10:05:08Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/releases/tag/v1.0.3"/>
    <title>faster-whisper 1.0.3</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;Upgrade Silero-Vad model to latest V5 version (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2379755552&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/884&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/884/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/884&quot;&gt;#884&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Silero-vad V5 release: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad/releases/tag/v5.0&quot;&gt;https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad/releases/tag/v5.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;window_size_samples parameter is fixed at 512.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change to use the state variable instead of the existing h and c variables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Slightly changed internal logic, now some context (part of previous chunk) is passed along with the current chunk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change the dimensions of the state variable from 64 to 128.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Replace ONNX file with V5 version&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Other changes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve language detection when using clip_timestamps (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2332554624&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/867&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/867/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/867&quot;&gt;#867&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Docker file improvements (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2304329600&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/848&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/848/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/848&quot;&gt;#848&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fix &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2297228551&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/839&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/839/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/839&quot;&gt;#839&lt;/a&gt; incorrect clip_timestamps being used in model (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2299242912&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/842&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/842/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/842&quot;&gt;#842&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
