  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/600368121/v1.0.2</id>
    <updated>2024-05-06T02:08:27Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/releases/tag/v1.0.2"/>
    <title>faster-whisper 1.0.2</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add support for distil-large-v3 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2199958697&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/755&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/755/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/755&quot;&gt;#755&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;
The latest Distil-Whisper model, &lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/distil-whisper/distil-large-v3-ct2&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;distil-large-v3&lt;/a&gt;, is intrinsically designed to work with the OpenAI sequential algorithm.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benchmarks (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2217956441&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/773&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/773/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/773&quot;&gt;#773&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;
Introduces functionality to measure benchmarking for memory, Word Error Rate (WER), and speed in Faster-whisper.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support initializing more whisper model args (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2262851714&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/807&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/807/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/807&quot;&gt;#807&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small bug fix:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;code breaks if audio is empty (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2216944361&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/768&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/768/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/768&quot;&gt;#768&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foolproof: Disable VAD if clip_timestamps is in use (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2216987052&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/769&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/769/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/769&quot;&gt;#769&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;make faster_whisper.assets as a valid python package to distribute (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2218279601&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/774&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/774/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/774&quot;&gt;#774&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Loosen tokenizers version constraint (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2261820893&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/804&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/804/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/804&quot;&gt;#804&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CUDA version and updated installation instructions (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2234492650&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/785&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/785/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/785&quot;&gt;#785&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New feature from original openai Whisper project:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feature/add hotwords (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2165442015&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/731&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/731/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/731&quot;&gt;#731&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve language detection (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2165854929&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/732&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/732/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/732&quot;&gt;#732&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
