&lt;li&gt;Update logic to get segment from features before encoding (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2150989480&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/705&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/705/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/705&quot;&gt;#705&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
