  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/600368121/v1.0.0</id>
    <updated>2024-02-22T08:56:53Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/releases/tag/v1.0.0"/>
    <title>faster-whisper 1.0.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support distil-whisper model (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;1988829580&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/557&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/557/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/557&quot;&gt;#557&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br&gt;
Robust knowledge distillation of the Whisper model via large-scale pseudo-labelling.&lt;br&gt;
For more detail: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/huggingface/distil-whisper&quot;&gt;https://github.com/huggingface/distil-whisper&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upgrade ctranslate2 version to 4.0 to support CUDA 12 (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2143547431&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/694&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/694/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/694&quot;&gt;#694&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Upgrade PyAV version to 11.* to support Python3.12.x (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2129125254&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/679&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/679/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/679&quot;&gt;#679&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Small bug fixes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Illogical &quot;Avoid computing higher temperatures on no_speech&quot; (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2097064352&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/652&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/652/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/652&quot;&gt;#652&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;broken prompt_reset_on_temperature (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2025263457&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/604&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/604/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/604&quot;&gt;#604&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Word timing tweaks (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2036898574&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/616&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/616/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/616&quot;&gt;#616&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New improvements from original OpenAI Whisper project&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skip silence around hallucinations (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2083827684&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/646&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/646/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/646&quot;&gt;#646&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent infinite loop for out-of-bound timestamps in clip_timestamps (&lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;2146733494&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/issues/697&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/697/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper/pull/697&quot;&gt;#697&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
