    <title>faster-whisper 0.10.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support &quot;large-v3&quot; model with
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to load &lt;code&gt;feature_size/num_mels&lt;/code&gt; and other from &lt;code&gt;preprocessor_config.json&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A new language token for Cantonese (&lt;code&gt;yue&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update &lt;code&gt;CTranslate2&lt;/code&gt; requirement to include the latest version 3.22.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Update &lt;code&gt;tokenizers&lt;/code&gt; requirement to include the latest version 0.15&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change the hub to fetch models from &lt;a href=&quot;https://huggingface.co/Systran&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Systran organization&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
